    "detailed_description": "Welcome to 'Bodyguard Task Force,' the VR game that puts you in the shoes of a bodyguard on a mission to ensure the safety of VIPs. Play solo or team up online for cooperative play as you navigate through a variety of missions, each presenting unique challenges. From urban landscapes to potential threats, every bullet counts in this heart-pounding experience. Compete on the leaderboard to showcase your skills and become the ultimate protector.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play Solo or team up with 3 other friends in multiplayer Coop. <br></li><li>Deploy a variety of weapons and attachments.<br></li><li>Diverse missions set in a range of environments for you to select from.<br></li><li>Unpredictable enemies each playthrough.<br></li><li>Compete to attain the highests ranks on the global leaderboard.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to 'Bodyguard Task Force,' the VR game that puts you in the shoes of a bodyguard on a mission to ensure the safety of VIPs. Play solo or team up online for cooperative play as you navigate through a variety of missions, each presenting unique challenges. From urban landscapes to potential threats, every bullet counts in this heart-pounding experience. Compete on the leaderboard to showcase your skills and become the ultimate protector.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play Solo or team up with 3 other friends in multiplayer Coop. <br></li><li>Deploy a variety of weapons and attachments.<br></li><li>Diverse missions set in a range of environments for you to select from.<br></li><li>Unpredictable enemies each playthrough.<br></li><li>Compete to attain the highests ranks on the global leaderboard.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Your mission is clear: go solo or team up with 3 other friends to ensure the safety of high-profile VIPs through a series of dynamic and challenging scenarios.",
